				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edefabry" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3385787); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3385787&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607950783" alt="EdeFabry" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3385787)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edefabry" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3385787); return false;" >EdeFabry</a></span> <span class="odate time_1508037630 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Oct 2017 03:20</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3613471">
									

<p>This isn't a tale/narrative in the proper sense. My nights are usually filled with nightmares. This one came after a SCP reading marathon and felt a lot less stale than the usual ones, and as such, worth writing down. My modus operandi was to recall said nightmare as accurately as possible, as many times as needed and take note of the sensations, words and feeling, without adding or taking away for the sake of narration. Some parts invoked feelings so unusual words failed to describe them, I have left those out, for now.</p>
<hr />

							</div>

								
					
